<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="h-full">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <base href="/" />
    <title>MinGo Service Registry</title>

    @* Tailwind CSS v4 browser build (CDN). Scans the DOM at runtime; no build step required. *@
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@@tailwindcss/browser@@4"></script>

    @* Material Design 3 tokens exposed as Tailwind v4 @@theme variables so utilities like
       bg-md-primary / text-md-on-surface resolve from the palette below. *@
    <style type="text/tailwindcss">
        @@theme {
            --color-md-primary: #6750A4;
            --color-md-on-primary: #FFFFFF;
            --color-md-primary-container: #EADDFF;
            --color-md-on-primary-container: #21005D;
            --color-md-secondary: #625B71;
            --color-md-on-secondary: #FFFFFF;
            --color-md-secondary-container: #E8DEF8;
            --color-md-on-secondary-container: #1D192B;
            --color-md-tertiary: #7D5260;
            --color-md-tertiary-container: #FFD8E4;
            --color-md-surface: #FEF7FF;
            --color-md-surface-container: #F3EDF7;
            --color-md-surface-variant: #E7E0EC;
            --color-md-on-surface: #1D1B20;
            --color-md-on-surface-variant: #49454F;
            --color-md-outline: #79747E;
            --color-md-outline-variant: #CAC4D0;
            --color-md-error: #B3261E;
            --color-md-on-error: #FFFFFF;
            --color-md-error-container: #F9DEDC;
            --color-md-on-error-container: #410E0B;
            --color-md-success: #2E7D32;
            --color-md-success-container: #C8E6C9;
            --color-md-on-success-container: #0B2E13;
            --color-md-warning: #B26A00;
            --color-md-warning-container: #FFEFB7;
            --color-md-on-warning-container: #3B2400;

            --radius-md-xs: 4px;
            --radius-md-sm: 8px;
            --radius-md-md: 12px;
            --radius-md-lg: 16px;
            --radius-md-xl: 28px;

            --shadow-md-1: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.30), 0 1px 3px 1px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
            --shadow-md-2: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.30), 0 2px 6px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.15);

            --font-roboto: "Roboto", "Segoe UI", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;

            --text-md-label-small: 0.6875rem;
            --text-md-label: 0.8125rem;
            --text-md-body-small: 0.75rem;
            --text-md-body: 0.875rem;
            --text-md-title: 1rem;
            --text-md-headline-small: 1.25rem;
            --text-md-headline: 1.5rem;
        }

        @@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            @@theme {
                --color-md-primary: #D0BCFF;
                --color-md-on-primary: #381E72;
                --color-md-primary-container: #4F378B;
                --color-md-on-primary-container: #EADDFF;
                --color-md-secondary: #CCC2DC;
                --color-md-on-secondary: #332D41;
                --color-md-secondary-container: #4A4458;
                --color-md-on-secondary-container: #E8DEF8;
                --color-md-surface: #141218;
                --color-md-surface-container: #211F26;
                --color-md-surface-variant: #49454F;
                --color-md-on-surface: #E6E0E9;
                --color-md-on-surface-variant: #CAC4D0;
                --color-md-outline: #938F99;
                --color-md-outline-variant: #49454F;
                --color-md-error: #F2B8B5;
                --color-md-error-container: #8C1D18;
                --color-md-on-error-container: #F9DEDC;
                --color-md-success: #A5D6A7;
                --color-md-success-container: #1B3A20;
                --color-md-on-success-container: #C8E6C9;
                --color-md-warning: #FFD180;
                --color-md-warning-container: #4A3300;
                --color-md-on-warning-container: #FFEFB7;
            }
        }

        @@keyframes md-indeterminate {
            0%   { transform: translateX(-100%); }
            50%  { transform: translateX(150%); }
            100% { transform: translateX(300%); }
        }

        html, body {
            height: 100%;
            background-color: var(--color-md-surface);
            color: var(--color-md-on-surface);
            font-family: var(--font-roboto);
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
        }
    </style>

    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="favicon.ico" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

    <ImportMap />
    <HeadOutlet @rendermode="InteractiveAuto" />
</head>
<body class="h-full">
    @* Global interactivity: Routes lives in the Client assembly, so it is resolvable on WebAssembly
       and serves as the single interactive Auto root. Everything it renders (MainLayout, nav, the
       render-mode badge and the pages) sits inside the interactive tree and hands off from Server
       to WebAssembly once the client bundle is cached. App itself stays static SSR (it is the HTML
       host and is never instantiated on WebAssembly). *@
    <Routes @rendermode="InteractiveAuto" />

    <script src="_framework/blazor.web.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
